  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Next\n\nFirst release of the `coderules` .NET tool.\n\n- `coderules run` finds every code rule project of a solution (`IsCodeRuleProject`) and runs its `ICodeRuleSetup` natively, without a test framework; the solution is parsed once, even for several projects.\n- Filters `--project`, `--rule`, `--group` and `--tag` (repeatable, `*` patterns); a filter that matches nothing is an error, never a green run.\n- `coderules list` (rules with group, pack and tags) and `coderules packs` (projects, rule packs with version, rules per group).\n- `--pack <dll>` runs a rule pack ad hoc against any solution, without a code rule project.\n- `--format human|ai`: live console output with clickable `path:line:column` locations, or one JSON document with a `rerun` command per result.\n- Exit codes 0 (passed), 1 (findings) and 2 (a rule could not run or the setup is invalid) for git hooks, CI and AI agents.",
